{"u": "10769037074", "name": "[DUELS] Rally Panic!", "place": "138572313449154", "created": "2026-10-02", "updated": "2026-10-25T12:32:44.717Z", "genre": "Sports & Racing", "subgenre": "Racing", "desc": "New code at 5,000 likes!\n\n🏁 One drives. One navigates. Both panic.\n\nRally with a friend or solo in this rally game! The driver goes full send: sideways, flat out, and blind to the route. The navigator holds the map and calls out turns, hazards and which road to take.\n\n🗺️ 25 stages across 5 maps: cherry blossom passes, haunted Halloween roads, pine forests, ravine ridges and frozen tundra (With more to come!)\n\n🚗 20+ cars to unlock, from pickups and vans to JDM drift legends\n\n🎨 100+ ways to customize: paints, premium finishes, liveries, rims, underglow and charms\n\n⚔️ Duels: race another crew head to head\n\n🎁 Loot boxes with a chance at a Mythic car\n\n🚧 Avoid wrong turns and dead ends\n\n🗣️ Communicate fast and trust your teammate\n\nChoose your roles and work together to reach the finish. Can your friendship survive the next hairpin?\n\n🎮 Inspired by \"Left Left LEFT!\" by Stellux Interactive. Thank you for the inspiration!", "desc_hash": "a5ac44debdf8", "max_players": 16, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 16443624, "favorites": 140111, "creator": {"id": 964485328, "name": "nonlethal studios", "type": "Group", "verified": false}, "daily": {"2026-10-14": {"updated": "2026-10-14T17:22:26.735Z", "visits": 2742600, "fav": 34857, "up": 1363, "down": 185}, "2026-10-15": {"updated": "2026-10-15T05:29:26.971Z", "visits": 3332955, "fav": 39714, "up": 1294, "down": 209}, "2026-10-16": {"updated": "2026-10-16T16:59:20.755Z", "visits": 4011668, "fav": 45307, "up": 1483, "down": 242}, "2026-10-17": {"updated": "2026-10-17T09:59:16.653Z", "visits": 5341100, "fav": 56713, "up": 1841, "down": 288}, "2026-10-18": {"updated": "2026-10-18T13:48:37.78Z", "visits": 7267441, "fav": 72819, "up": 2408, "down": 376}, "2026-10-19": {"updated": "2026-1